From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: alpine-sbc <alpine-sbc@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 18:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] qemu-arm: do not delay the standard bootflow

The image has a single validated boot entry.  Keep the U-Boot autoboot path
interruptible, but do not add its default two-second prompt delay to every
QEMU boot test or deployment.
---
 board/emulation/qemu-arm/qemu-arm.env | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/board/emulation/qemu-arm/qemu-arm.env b/board/emulation/qemu-arm/qemu-arm.env
index 2e2a8a1b15..0000000000 100644
--- a/board/emulation/qemu-arm/qemu-arm.env
+++ b/board/emulation/qemu-arm/qemu-arm.env
@@ -13,2 +13,3 @@ kernel_addr_r=0x40400000
 ramdisk_addr_r=0x44000000
 boot_targets=qfw usb scsi virtio nvme dhcp
+bootdelay=0
-- 
2.47.2
